# A crowded timeline: close dates alternate above and below, every other pair further out.
title "The road to 1914"
schema timeline
mark a dot crisis t=1905 label="First Moroccan Crisis"
mark b dot crisis t=1908 label="Bosnian annexation"
mark c dot war t=1912 label="First Balkan War"
mark d dot war t=1913 label="Second Balkan War"
mark e dot trigger t=1914 label="Sarajevo"
mark f dot war t=1914.6 label="War declared"
Say: "Crisis after crisis, each one closer to the edge."
